Any person required by this ordinance to register his or her business shall notify the Occupation Tax Officer in writing within 30 days of the following changes:
A. Any change of address of the business, in which case the same occupation tax certificate shall be valid at the new location provided that approval from the Planning and Zoning Department is received for the new location in advance of the change;
